    "recovered/mesh.c: ARMv7 non-fused VMLA; no measured FPS gain",
    "Component-aware parent sync memo; exact single-point column SIMD and four-point normalized patch batching. Correctness checks passed; current three-character device scene shows no measurable FPS gain.",
