    "Pose helper calls pass the selected model context explicitly, reducing emulated TLS lookups without changing arithmetic.",
    "Fixed control-patch blend, parent composition and affine mapping use ARM NEON with unchanged scalar operation order.",
    "Win differential-only loop lanes preserve live transition controllers across the first wrap instead of analytically resetting to Play-time initial values.",
    "Reuse immutable local poses for empty frames while retaining frame, next-key and seek invalidation and live parent/child evaluation.",
    "Memoize immutable layer anchor-name demand per view, invalidating it on scene reload and controller metadata rebinding; retain live anchor coordinates, first-match traversal and physics updates.",
    "Pair X/Y control-point loads in the bounded render-grid NEON kernel, retaining each coordinate reduction order and exact-kernel fallback.",
    "Prepare immutable world-patch control bounds once per deformation for reuse across sprites; retain live per-vertex inverse-map checks and exact fallback.",
    "Decode ASTC_8BPP through an optional host callback into shared RGBA storage; validate payload length and preserve deferred upload lifetime. CPU sample and ABI tests passed; original 64x56 ASTC sample rendered on PSV with both backends."
